 unless noted.","source_url":"https://www.winonamn.gov/780/Outdoor-Recreation","source_title":"Outdoor Recreation | City of Winona","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City outdoor-recreation page says all areas are free unless noted; use the map and respect posted trail guidance.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sugar-loaf-trail","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Sugar Loaf Trail","title":"Hike the Sugar Loaf Trail","subtitle":"Sugar Loaf, Winona","notes":"Plan a daylight hike with sturdy shoes, pause at safe viewpoints, and head back before dark. Follow the city map instead of making an off-trail route.","short_summary":"A mapped Sugar Loaf outing that costs nothing to access.","evidence_claim":"The City of Winona provides a Sugar Loaf and Winona Ice Park map within its outdoor-recreation resources and states that all areas are free unless noted.","source_url":"https://www.winonamn.gov/780/Outdoor-Recreation","source_title":"Outdoor Recreation | City of Winona","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City outdoor-recreation page says all areas are free unless noted; hike only marked routes and check conditions.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"east-lake-path","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"East Lake Path","title":"Circle Part of East Lake","subtitle":"East Lake Path, Winona","notes":"Meet at a convenient access point and walk or roll a section of the paved lakeside path. The full East Lake route is listed as 3.7 miles.","short_summary":"A paved lakeside route suited to a flexible-length hang.","evidence_claim":"The City of Winona lists East Lake as a 3.7-mile path and states that all outdoor-recreation areas are free unless noted.","source_url":"https://www.winonamn.gov/780/Outdoo